    "summary": "At muster, a friendly ANATHEMA PSYKANA CHARACTER can serve as WARLORD. Your PROSECUTOR SQUADS gain BATTLELINE. All friendly ANATHEMA PSYKANA units project Creeping Dread (Aura). In the enemy Command phase’s Battle-shock step, each enemy up to 12 inches from the emitter rolls for Battle-shock with a penalty of 1 if it has PSYKER or is below its starting strength.",
